<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry FY98 EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry FY98 EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it increased its FY98 earnings per share estimate on DeVry Inc to $0.86 from $0.83. It maintained its estimate for the fiscal year ending June 1997 of $0.70.</p>
<p>--EVEREN said it boosted its FY98 estimate to reflect an increase in its revenue assumption due to the timing and magnitude of new school openings.</p>
<p>--DeVry was off 1/4 at 22-5/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
